						],
						"pointId": 5892
					}
				]
			},
			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 740820101,
					"content": "(Most of the inscription has been scratched out, but you can make out \"...clear dew... sings on the Foggy Forest Path...\")",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740820102
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Carved Stone Tablet"
				},
				{
					"id": 740820102,
					"content": "Whoa! So many words have been scratched out! These look like introductions to attractions, don't they? Bah, some tourists are just so inconsiderate.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740820103
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 740820103,
					"content": "Tourists usually only write stuff, don't they?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740820104
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 740820104,
					"content": "#Hmm... That's true, like writing \"{NICKNAME} and Paimon were here\" and stuff... No! Wait! We're good people, we wouldn't do that...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740820105
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 740820105,
					"content": "Then it's strange, isn't it? Why would they scratch out the words? And just leave that bit in...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740820106
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 740820106,
					"content": "There are so many scratches on this sentence too! Paimon bets they didn't manage to scratch it out completely! Lucky Foggy Forest Path, you slipped through the cracks...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740820107
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 740820107,
					"content": "So, what is this Foggy Forest Path?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740820108
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 740820108,
					"content": "Hmm... Do they mean that the forest paths are super foggy?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740820109
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 740820109,
					"content": "Paimon feels like checking it out! Y'know, it sounds like the sort of thing that might lead to secret treasure, doesn't it? That's how it is in the books, anyway. Hehe.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740820110,
						740820111
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 740820110,
					"content": "Which stall did you get that book from?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740820112
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 740820112,
					"content": "Hey! Paimon doesn't just eat all day! Paimon has a strong feeling that there's treasure hidden in this Foggy Forest Path, and that's why it was covered up!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740820113
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 740820113,
					"content": "#Never mind that, {NICKNAME}! It's treasure-hunting time with your best friend, Paimon, and her super treasure-detecting senses!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 740820111,
					"content": "Which library did you get that book from?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740820112
					]
				}
			]
		},
